menu "Satellite"

    config SATELLITE_WIFI_SSID
        string "Wi-Fi SSID"
        default ""
        help
            The 2.4 GHz network the satellite joins. The ESP32-S3 has no
            5 GHz radio, so a 5 GHz-only SSID simply never appears in a scan.

    config SATELLITE_WIFI_PASSWORD
        string "Wi-Fi password"
        default ""
        help
            Empty means an open network. WPA2 or newer is used otherwise.

    config SATELLITE_SERVER_URI
        string "Voice WebSocket URI"
        default "ws://192.168.1.10:8000/ws/voice"
        help
            The voice socket, without the API key: the firmware appends
            ?api_key= itself. A development server listens on 8000; the
            deployed stack publishes the socket through nginx on 8080.
            Plain ws:// only, because the deployment terminates no TLS for
            LAN devices.

    config SATELLITE_API_KEY
        string "Shared API key"
        default ""
        help
            The value of ASSISTANT_API_KEY on the server. It is stored in
            sdkconfig, which is gitignored, so it never reaches the repository.
            A device with a wrong key is refused with close code 1008.

endmenu
